id":"c110","house":"rhino","letter":"L151","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT NORTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT JKQTD OMJG IESSHA."},{"seq":407,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1810,"retries":0},{"seq":408,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 8. My doctrine says take the middle ford (F2) in the first five watches and hold it. I should have done this earlier. I must now act on captured enemy mail. Rhino seems to be near North Bank Middle (N-mid). I will move my forces to engage them or secure F2 if possible"},{"seq":409,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c111","house":"kite","letter":"L152","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, ITQLD SK IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":410,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c112","house":"kite","letter":"L153","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, ITQLD SK IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":411,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c113","house":"kite","letter":"L154","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village"],"depart":2400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":412,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1610,"retries":0},{"seq":413,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino and Tiger have truces. I need to secure two fords. My infantry is at F1 (2w old). I should push towards F2 or F3. I'll move my archers/cavalry to support a push towards F2, while keeping an eye on Tiger's position near F1."},{"seq":414,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c114","house":"orchid","letter":"L155","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":415,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c115","house":"orchid","letter":"L156","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":2100,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":416,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1624,"retries":0},{"seq":417,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"It is watch 8. My doctrine is to take the west ford (F1) early and hold it. Orchid has a truce, so I should try to make a friend or exploit the truce. I see Orchid inf at F1 (2w ago). I will move my forces to challenge F1 or secure F2/F3. I will reinforce my presence near F1."},{"seq":418,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c116","house":"tiger","letter":"L157","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","s-west"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":419,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c117","house":"tiger","letter":"L158","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid","F2","n-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":420,"t":2100,"type":"delivered","courier":"c105","letter":"L140","house":"kite"},{"seq":421,"t":2100,"type":"delivered","courier":"c115","letter":"L156","house":"orchid"},{"seq":422,"t":2101,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-inf-2","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":406},{"seq":423,"t":2101,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-ele-1","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":406},{"seq":424,"t":2103,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-inf-2","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":407},{"seq":425,"t":2105,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-inf-2","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":408},{"seq":426,"t":2106,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-ele-1","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":408},{"seq":427,"t":2107,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-inf-2","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":408},{"seq":428,"t":2109,"type":"clash","a":"rhino-inf-2","b":"tiger-inf-2","x":500,"y":409},{"seq":429,"t":2110,"t